"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"If DevServices has been explicitly enabled or disabled. DevServices is "
"generally enabled by default, unless there is an existing configuration "
"present.\n"
"When DevServices is enabled Quarkus will attempt to automatically configure "
"and start a database when running in Dev or Test mode and when Docker is "
"running.\n"
"\n"
